   "title": "Find the union",
   "answer": 17,
   "prompt": "\\( n(A) = 12,\\ n(B) = 9,\\ n(A \\cap B) = 4 \\). Find \\( n(A \\cup B) \\).",
   "hint": "Add n(A) and n(B), then subtract the overlap.",
   "explain": "\\( 12 + 9 - 4 = 17 \\)."
